WEBVTT

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.320 --> 01:38.920
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:42.000 --> 01:42.720
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

01:42.800 --> 01:45.200
Sir, to get this person out of the manor,

01:45.280 --> 01:46.800
we took advantage of the Nuo troupe.

01:46.880 --> 01:49.280
While they were hauling their drum boxes,

01:49.360 --> 01:51.560
we slipped out of the Duke's Residence.

01:51.640 --> 01:54.480
Good work. A generous reward awaits.

01:54.560 --> 01:55.720
Thank you, Sir.

01:57.320 --> 01:58.720
Lady Lu,

01:59.480 --> 02:03.040
despite your careful calculations,
you still end up in my hands.

02:03.840 --> 02:04.880
Well?

02:05.880 --> 02:09.120
It must feel bad
being trapped inside a box.

02:11.520 --> 02:12.680
Calm down.

02:13.640 --> 02:16.040
I know you are a fake.

02:16.120 --> 02:20.080
As long as you obey
and help me out with something,

02:20.160 --> 02:23.480
I will send you back unharmed.

02:25.880 --> 02:26.720
Sir!

02:29.120 --> 02:30.320
I don't care who you are.

02:30.400 --> 02:31.960
Release me immediately!

02:32.040 --> 02:36.280
Any later, I'll tear you limb from limb
and mince you to a pulp.

02:43.480 --> 02:44.880
Who are you?

02:45.480 --> 02:47.240
How dare you act so arrogantly?

02:48.840 --> 02:51.160
You kidnapped me without knowing who I am?

02:53.200 --> 02:55.360
Old Madam Wei of the Earl
of Cheng'an's Residence is my…

02:59.640 --> 03:00.600
God-grandmother.

03:02.120 --> 03:04.760
She treats me like her own granddaughter.

03:04.840 --> 03:06.960
If you don't send me back safely,

03:07.040 --> 03:08.400
I'll report you to the officials
and have you executed!

03:09.000 --> 03:10.240
God-grandmother?

03:13.560 --> 03:14.760
I think

03:16.280 --> 03:17.800
she is your actual grandmother.

03:24.800 --> 03:26.840
-What nonsense are you talking about?
-What?

03:26.920 --> 03:29.760
The fake is pretending to be a noble lady,
and the real one is a shrew?

03:31.800 --> 03:35.480
What in the world
is the Wei family trying to achieve?

03:38.040 --> 03:39.200
Who do you think you are?

03:39.280 --> 03:42.360
Whether I'm real or a fake
is none of your business!

03:42.440 --> 03:43.280
Let me out!

03:44.480 --> 03:46.480
What a crazy woman.

03:46.560 --> 03:48.200
Let me out!

03:48.280 --> 03:50.760
Help! Someone!

03:50.840 --> 03:52.600
She's worse than the fake one.

03:52.680 --> 03:53.800
Hurry and shut her mouth!

03:53.880 --> 03:56.360
Someone! Help!

03:56.440 --> 03:58.480
Don't touch me!

03:59.440 --> 04:00.680
-Don't touch me!
-Rao!

04:01.720 --> 04:02.560
Get lost!

04:08.640 --> 04:09.480
Get up.

04:12.120 --> 04:15.360
A mere merchant
dares to trespass on my residence?

04:16.200 --> 04:17.680
Capture them immediately!

04:18.519 --> 04:19.360
Who dares?

04:29.280 --> 04:31.320
I just left the city
and came across Grandmother's convoy.

04:32.040 --> 04:35.560
Only then did I realize she rushed back
to celebrate the Duchess' birthday.

04:35.640 --> 04:37.160
Unfortunately, a storm held her her up

04:37.240 --> 04:38.240
and delayed her journey.

04:40.280 --> 04:42.120
I failed to welcome my esteemed guest.

04:42.200 --> 04:44.320
Lady Shou'an, please forgive me.

04:44.920 --> 04:47.320
Enough. Cut the pleasantries.

04:47.840 --> 04:49.680
I don't like fake, pretentious behavior.

04:50.680 --> 04:53.280
I'm exhausted from the arduous journey.

04:53.800 --> 04:56.120
I have no patience for your idle chatter.

04:56.200 --> 04:58.200
I'm taking her away.

05:02.080 --> 05:05.240
Lady Shou'an,
I can't stop you from leaving.

05:06.040 --> 05:09.040
However, this woman
pretended to be a noble's wife.

05:09.120 --> 05:11.520
She acted suspiciously,
and her identity is a mystery.

05:11.600 --> 05:13.080
We cannot let her walk away.

05:17.840 --> 05:19.720
Who am I?

05:28.080 --> 05:30.040
Surely, you are His Majesty's wet nurse.

05:30.640 --> 05:31.880
No commoner has ever been
admitted to such nobility.

05:31.960 --> 05:36.400
But you are the first wet nurse to
be granted a fief and a title in this era.

05:36.480 --> 05:39.400
Everyone in the capital knows who you are.

05:41.360 --> 05:45.000
I thought you were so blind
as not to recognize me.

05:46.040 --> 05:49.560
I raised His Majesty all on my own.

05:50.240 --> 05:53.520
Even your father's horse carriage
has to show respect

05:53.600 --> 05:56.440
and make way when it sees me.

05:57.400 --> 05:58.520
You?

06:00.040 --> 06:02.240
Barely out of the cradle

06:02.760 --> 06:04.400
and you dare speak up to me?

06:05.480 --> 06:08.360
If you don't let her go,
believe it or not,

06:08.440 --> 06:11.320
I'll burn all your manors to the ground.

06:11.400 --> 06:15.360
Next, I'll accuse the Hans
of bullying a lone old woman!

06:16.400 --> 06:20.720
Let's see if His Majesty
is going to seek justice for me.

06:29.880 --> 06:31.520
Who else dares to stop me?

06:43.400 --> 06:44.480
Let's go.

06:52.960 --> 06:55.880
Keep a close eye on Duke's Residence
and Xianzhuang for me.

06:55.960 --> 06:58.320
I don't care if she's real or fake.

06:59.200 --> 07:03.560
I must find real proof
before I deal with her.

07:04.560 --> 07:05.400
Yes.

07:14.840 --> 07:16.520
Who are you, really?

07:28.000 --> 07:30.600
Nuo dancers might be able
to communicate with the supernatural,

07:30.680 --> 07:32.120
but their income is a pittance.

07:32.720 --> 07:34.080
Dancers are not allowed
to show their faces.

07:34.680 --> 07:37.120
Those who practice it
usually come from poor families.

07:37.200 --> 07:39.320
How is it possible
that a daughter of an earl

07:40.200 --> 07:41.760
knows the Nuo dance?

07:43.600 --> 07:46.000
Because doing the Nuo dance
at the temple ritual every year

07:46.080 --> 07:47.960
earns me an extra 30 coins.

07:49.520 --> 07:52.400
The types of dance popular in the capital
are light and elegant,

07:52.960 --> 07:55.520
but my maternal grandmother
thinks it lacks strength and vigor.

07:56.480 --> 07:58.280
She likes watching
Nuo dance and Sword dance.

07:58.360 --> 08:00.400
Nuo dance steps are easy to learn.

08:00.920 --> 08:06.040
Longsword dance or Dagger play
are something I dare not perform.

08:06.640 --> 08:09.840
Back then, my birth mother
could sing and dance well.

08:09.920 --> 08:11.560
She never forgets a song she learns,

08:11.640 --> 08:13.200
but often draws criticism.

08:14.000 --> 08:15.520
Grandmother didn't like it either,

08:15.600 --> 08:17.440
so she never allows me to perform.

08:18.720 --> 08:19.960
That was why I didn't tell you.

08:27.720 --> 08:30.320
I only performed it in front of others
for this birthday banquet.

08:31.240 --> 08:34.120
My Lord, why do you doubt me?

08:35.640 --> 08:39.200
When you met Xie Hualou in the past,
you'd go mad.

08:39.799 --> 08:42.360
You'd use the world's
most despicable schemes

08:42.440 --> 08:45.000
just to defeat and humiliate your enemy.

08:45.760 --> 08:48.920
Tonight, even if you were backed
into a corner by the Xies,

08:50.040 --> 08:52.120
you were still acting calm and collected.

08:53.240 --> 08:57.040
Wei Rao, when did you get so generous?

08:57.720 --> 08:59.200
All the elders were present.

09:00.760 --> 09:02.360
I must consider the greater good.

09:02.440 --> 09:04.560
You had a secret chat
with your cousin Huo.

09:05.960 --> 09:07.040
What did you two talk about?

09:07.840 --> 09:09.360
Private matters between relatives.

09:09.440 --> 09:10.360
I was afraid Grandmother…

09:10.440 --> 09:12.360
Why did you get angry
and toss the Hans' gift

09:12.440 --> 09:13.960
and ignore the guests?

09:14.480 --> 09:16.240
You were away from the banquet,

09:16.320 --> 09:18.840
yet the servants saw Qi Zhongkai
send you back to the banquet.

09:18.920 --> 09:21.160
Your cousin left the banquet rudely.

09:21.240 --> 09:22.200
Why was that?

09:25.920 --> 09:27.480
-I…
-I want to hear the truth.

09:32.720 --> 09:34.200
Compared to when I first met you,

09:35.080 --> 09:37.600
your temperament, manner,
and conduct are all different.

09:38.760 --> 09:42.560
Within two months,
how could there be such a big difference?

09:43.280 --> 09:44.400
Who are you?

09:47.960 --> 09:50.720
Tell me. Who in the world are you?

10:17.240 --> 10:18.440
What are you doing?

10:22.880 --> 10:23.960
Who am I?

10:25.840 --> 10:26.800
My Lord.

10:28.680 --> 10:30.080
Tell me who I am.

10:31.520 --> 10:33.760
Wei Rao, put on your clothes immediately.

10:43.040 --> 10:45.840
Even if I'm standing in front of you
with all my clothes removed,

10:45.920 --> 10:47.640
you won't spare me a second glance.

10:54.920 --> 10:57.000
I am your wife who disgusts you.

11:14.680 --> 11:15.560
Lu Zhuo!

11:25.680 --> 11:27.560
As the heir, you need a wife
who is dignified,

11:28.080 --> 11:29.480
gracious, gentle and virtuous.

11:30.160 --> 11:31.880
I changed myself for you.

11:32.600 --> 11:34.080
I changed my temperament.

11:35.040 --> 11:37.280
I spent my efforts organizing the banquet.

11:38.800 --> 11:40.960
I showed myself
and performed in front of everyone

11:41.840 --> 11:45.480
just to win your favor.

11:53.280 --> 11:54.240
What about you?

11:55.360 --> 11:57.360
You sat there,

11:59.240 --> 12:02.280
and watched as I endured the pain,
barely able to stand.

12:02.360 --> 12:05.280
You never said a word of concern.

12:05.360 --> 12:07.920
Instead, you suspected and questioned me.

12:11.560 --> 12:12.400
Who am I?

12:15.760 --> 12:17.600
Tell me who I am.

12:18.200 --> 12:20.680
I'm a fool who gave my heart
to the wrong person!

12:33.400 --> 12:34.240
My Lord, remember.

12:35.280 --> 12:39.200
What I said to General Qi
and my conversation with my cousin

12:39.280 --> 12:40.520
are my family matters.

12:43.000 --> 12:44.720
We'll only be married for a year.

12:44.800 --> 12:45.840
You are not my husband.

12:45.920 --> 12:46.920
Who I meet is none of your business.

12:48.160 --> 12:49.640
A year from now, we will part ways.

12:50.480 --> 12:52.360
I don't care who you'd marry.

12:52.440 --> 12:53.720
You should leave me alone as well.

12:54.320 --> 12:55.240
From now on,

12:56.320 --> 13:00.040
No prying, no digging,
never enter my room for no reason.

13:00.840 --> 13:02.960
Otherwise, I'll pack up
and return home immediately.

13:03.040 --> 13:04.680
You can explain it to Old Madam yourself.

13:05.400 --> 13:06.240
Get out!

13:07.360 --> 13:08.320
I didn't mean to offend you.

13:08.400 --> 13:09.720
Listen to me…

13:31.480 --> 13:32.360
My Lord.

13:35.320 --> 13:36.320
She is ill?

13:36.840 --> 13:38.040
Why didn't you get the physician?

13:38.120 --> 13:39.760
Forgive me, My Lord.

13:39.840 --> 13:41.400
Madam was busy on the banquet for days

13:41.480 --> 13:42.400
and felt a sudden pain in her stomach.

13:43.000 --> 13:44.000
She was worried that others might know

13:44.080 --> 13:46.200
and thought she was too weak
to carry out the task.

13:46.280 --> 13:48.120
She doesn't want to cause you trouble,

13:48.200 --> 13:49.480
so I was not allowed to speak about it.

13:51.160 --> 13:52.720
-Jiede.
-Yes.

13:52.800 --> 13:53.960
Take my slip

13:54.480 --> 13:56.320
and call Physician Yang from the palace
who excels at treating stomach pains.

13:56.920 --> 13:58.000
Yes, My Lord.

14:05.880 --> 14:08.320
XIANZHUANG

14:08.400 --> 14:10.720
Tell me. What actually happened?

14:10.800 --> 14:12.200
Maternal Grandmother.

14:13.560 --> 14:15.960
I made a mistake as a clueless child

14:16.560 --> 14:19.400
and was banished
from the family by Grandmother.

14:20.080 --> 14:21.960
I have nowhere to go.

14:22.040 --> 14:23.840
Maternal Grandmother,

14:23.920 --> 14:29.000
please pity me for being a lonely orphan
and take me in.

14:29.080 --> 14:30.280
Don't chase me away.

14:30.880 --> 14:33.840
That old woman from the Wei family
expelled you?

14:34.840 --> 14:36.480
How cruel.

14:37.080 --> 14:38.880
While her decision might be justified,

14:38.960 --> 14:40.840
she is still a descendant
of the family after all.

14:41.360 --> 14:43.520
Old Madam Wei was too harsh.

14:45.480 --> 14:47.960
Maternal Grandmother,
please stand up for Rao.

14:48.920 --> 14:50.000
If that's what really happened,

14:50.080 --> 14:55.320
I'll march straight to the Weis
and give them what they deserve

14:55.400 --> 14:56.280
but…

14:58.600 --> 14:59.440
But why?

15:00.400 --> 15:01.920
Why did she become so livid

15:02.000 --> 15:03.480
that she kicked out her own granddaughter?

15:04.440 --> 15:06.720
You are the heir's wife.

15:06.800 --> 15:08.000
What makes her think
she could kick you out?

15:12.280 --> 15:14.120
Dowager Lady, Old Madam Wei is here.

15:14.800 --> 15:16.040
Nice timing.

15:17.080 --> 15:18.880
Rao, leave for now.

15:19.720 --> 15:20.600
I…

15:21.520 --> 15:22.920
Be patient.

15:23.000 --> 15:24.080
Maternal Grandmother knows what to do.

15:30.440 --> 15:32.040
What a rare guest.

15:33.280 --> 15:37.760
The last time
we had a peaceful conversation

15:37.840 --> 15:40.440
was probably more than a decade ago.

15:41.320 --> 15:45.280
It was seventeen years ago,
the twenty-third of the last month.

15:45.800 --> 15:46.920
I will never forget.

15:47.680 --> 15:49.480
It was the Little New Year.

15:50.000 --> 15:53.200
Every household was cleaning
and paying respects to the Kitchen God.

15:54.360 --> 15:56.080
After the hour of Wu,

15:56.760 --> 16:00.880
my son's coffin
was carried into my residence's gates.

16:01.680 --> 16:05.800
My second son was stubborn
and knew what he wanted.

16:05.880 --> 16:09.480
I searched throughout the capital

16:09.560 --> 16:13.200
to finally find
a noble lady for him to marry.

16:13.280 --> 16:17.320
However, he'd rather be flogged 40 times

16:17.400 --> 16:20.040
just to refuse the marriage
and marry your daughter instead.

16:21.120 --> 16:23.280
Back then, I didn't stop him.

16:23.920 --> 16:26.040
Later, it became my greatest resentment.

16:26.120 --> 16:27.840
Time has passed.

16:27.920 --> 16:31.720
After so long,
why are you bringing this up?

16:31.800 --> 16:35.080
When your daughter, Zhou,
married into my household,

16:35.880 --> 16:38.920
he treated her with care.

16:39.600 --> 16:42.160
Zhou was good at dancing and music.

16:42.240 --> 16:45.960
My son searched all
over the capital for famous scores.

16:46.040 --> 16:49.080
Zhou was laughed at
because of her modest background.

16:49.160 --> 16:52.400
My son fought on the battlefield
to get her a title.

16:53.000 --> 16:56.440
My second son was
born handsome and courageous.

16:56.520 --> 16:58.360
He was skilled
in both the literary and martial arts.

16:58.440 --> 17:00.080
Everyone praised him.

17:00.160 --> 17:02.120
He was the pride of my life.

17:03.120 --> 17:06.240
But not long after he passed away,

17:06.800 --> 17:09.920
the woman he loved most abandoned him.

17:10.599 --> 17:16.079
She abandoned her young daughter
and went away to seek someone better.

17:16.599 --> 17:17.640
I hate it.

17:18.160 --> 17:20.520
I hate that daughter of yours, Zhou.

17:20.599 --> 17:22.960
I hate you, you old, shameless woman
who fawns over the powerful.

17:23.040 --> 17:25.800
I hate everyone in your household.

17:26.480 --> 17:29.480
It's because of you that my son,
who gave his life serving his country,

17:29.560 --> 17:31.880
is still mocked even after death.

17:32.400 --> 17:34.240
They laughed at him
and called him an idiot and a fool.

17:34.840 --> 17:40.120
His death brought your daughter
wealth, honor, and favor.

17:40.200 --> 17:43.920
He helped your household
gain fame, and power.

17:44.800 --> 17:47.640
You even harmed my granddaughter.

17:47.720 --> 17:49.600
She was afraid to go out
and show herself to others

17:49.680 --> 17:52.320
from a young age.

17:52.400 --> 17:54.640
It's only right for a widow to remarry.

17:54.720 --> 17:56.800
One must live one's own life.

17:56.880 --> 17:59.400
Why are you so hung up
on other people's opinions?

17:59.480 --> 18:02.160
You are the one
who is stubborn and close-minded.

18:02.240 --> 18:03.760
Yes. I am close-minded.

18:04.560 --> 18:07.440
Your daughter only cared
about her own glory

18:07.520 --> 18:12.640
and ignored the future life and reputation
of her infant daughter.

18:13.240 --> 18:16.960
If my second son hadn't
sacrificed his life to save the Lus,

18:17.040 --> 18:21.120
did you think Rao could marry
into the Lu household now?

18:21.720 --> 18:24.640
Look around the capital.

18:24.720 --> 18:26.800
None of the educated families

18:26.880 --> 18:29.480
dare to marry
a daughter of your Zhou family.

18:29.560 --> 18:31.880
Do you also want my granddaughter

18:31.960 --> 18:36.080
to disgrace herself
and marry a lowly merchant?

18:42.000 --> 18:43.520
You can remain scornful
as much as you want

18:44.120 --> 18:46.320
but you shouldn't neglect Rao.

18:47.480 --> 18:49.520
She was almost kidnapped.

18:50.120 --> 18:53.240
Thankfully, she is blessed.

18:53.320 --> 18:56.600
Otherwise, her fate
would still be unknown.

18:56.680 --> 18:58.160
If anyone should
harbor resentment, it's me.

18:58.240 --> 19:02.440
I resent myself
for being so soft-hearted and tolerant.

19:02.520 --> 19:07.080
I should've brought Rao home
so she wouldn't be neglected by you.

19:09.080 --> 19:13.560
I swear in the name of Heaven
and my late son.

19:13.640 --> 19:16.960
I've treated Rao the best I could.

19:17.480 --> 19:19.760
I might have spoiled her.

19:19.840 --> 19:24.400
That is why she acted without a care
and committed a grave mistake.

19:25.120 --> 19:29.560
She almost cost the lives
of everyone in the family.

19:32.040 --> 19:35.360
What did she do?

19:36.320 --> 19:37.880
Ask her yourself.

19:38.560 --> 19:41.440
However, I hope all of you remember this.

19:42.480 --> 19:46.280
Rao is my granddaughter
whom I raised myself.

19:46.360 --> 19:48.680
I gave her everything I had.

19:48.760 --> 19:51.840
What everyone else says means nothing.

19:52.520 --> 19:56.760
The one I say is my own,
that's my real granddaughter.

19:56.840 --> 19:58.920
Doesn't matter whose support she's got.

19:59.000 --> 20:03.320
Anyone who dares cause trouble here

20:03.400 --> 20:07.680
and drag the Wei family
into disgrace again

20:09.280 --> 20:10.920
don't blame me, a grandmother,

20:11.680 --> 20:13.280
for setting aside the ties of kinship.

20:14.880 --> 20:16.000
Let's go back.

20:21.640 --> 20:24.920
DEEP CLOUDS, TWILIGHT SEAS

20:45.760 --> 20:46.960
Maternal Grandmother,
you heard everything.

20:47.800 --> 20:49.480
Grandmother is cruel and vicious.

20:49.560 --> 20:51.040
She has disowned me.

20:54.440 --> 20:55.520
Kneel.

20:58.640 --> 20:59.720
Kneel!

21:00.640 --> 21:04.080
Tell me what you did honestly.

21:06.840 --> 21:09.080
-Kneel.
-I didn't do anything wrong. Why should I?

21:11.240 --> 21:14.080
Lu Zhuo was seriously injured
and was going to die.

21:14.160 --> 21:16.280
The Lus kept forcing me to get married.

21:16.360 --> 21:19.040
I didn't want to become a widow
so I found myself a substitute.

21:20.200 --> 21:22.320
Later, Lu Zhuo survived by luck.

21:22.400 --> 21:24.920
That wretch clung to her status
and wouldn't return the position.

21:25.000 --> 21:26.800
Why can't I kill her?

21:28.360 --> 21:31.800
How dare a lowly peasant stand against me?

21:34.520 --> 21:35.400
Maternal Grandmother.

21:36.040 --> 21:37.760
You're so domineering and willful.

21:37.840 --> 21:40.760
How are you anything like your mother?

21:40.840 --> 21:43.240
Maternal Grandmother, you're so unfair.

21:46.440 --> 21:50.360
Mother didn't want to become a widow,
so you asked her to marry someone else.

21:51.160 --> 21:53.120
You even praised her courage.

21:53.200 --> 21:55.480
How come it's wrong when I do the same?

21:55.560 --> 21:57.880
What? She shouldn't have
to be my father's widow,

21:57.960 --> 21:59.360
but I have to be Lu Zhuo's widow?

21:59.440 --> 22:00.960
You…

22:01.040 --> 22:03.640
Maternal Grandmother. Calm down.

22:04.240 --> 22:05.960
Rao is ignorant and reckless.

22:06.040 --> 22:07.120
She needs to be punished.

22:07.720 --> 22:10.440
But the important thing now
isn't getting angry at her,

22:10.520 --> 22:13.440
but to plan for her future.

22:17.760 --> 22:18.680
Keep talking.

22:21.480 --> 22:24.480
Maternal Grandmother,
I spoke with the wretch.

22:25.160 --> 22:27.920
She is cunning and calculative.

22:28.000 --> 22:30.480
Her flattering words
gained the Duchess' favor.

22:31.000 --> 22:31.880
Even Lord Lu was…

22:33.240 --> 22:34.880
He was bewitched by her.

22:35.400 --> 22:38.200
In a few days, she established
a foothold at the Duke's Residence.

22:38.800 --> 22:40.280
She's certainly no pushover.

22:40.880 --> 22:43.640
However, Old Madam Wei won't stand up
for Rao to protect her reputation.

22:44.760 --> 22:45.920
After this grave mistake,

22:46.000 --> 22:48.800
there is no choice
but to ask Aunt in the palace to…

22:48.880 --> 22:50.080
Shut up!

22:51.200 --> 22:54.200
Your aunt isn't the one
in control of the harem.

22:54.280 --> 22:56.640
Do you want her to go against
the Empress Dowager's decree?

22:57.240 --> 22:59.000
Her own daughter committed an atrocity.

22:59.080 --> 23:01.640
You're practically giving them
a knife to use against you.

23:04.160 --> 23:06.520
Maternal Grandmother,
you should send a message to Mother

23:06.600 --> 23:09.960
so she won't be fooled by an impostor
and treat her like her own daughter.

23:13.360 --> 23:14.800
What a tragedy.

23:14.880 --> 23:19.360
Your reckless actions last night
have probably given them a heads-up.

23:20.360 --> 23:23.960
Do not act recklessly anymore
unless you have a foolproof plan.

23:24.040 --> 23:26.680
The palace is full of prying eyes.

23:26.760 --> 23:29.320
We must be cautious when sending messages.

23:29.400 --> 23:32.120
I will find a way.
Let's wait for an opportunity.

23:32.800 --> 23:33.960
-I…
-Rao.

23:34.560 --> 23:36.200
We'll listen to you.

23:46.880 --> 23:48.080
We don't need you here anymore.

23:48.160 --> 23:49.280
You're dismissed.

23:49.360 --> 23:53.240
His Lordship ordered us
to watch Her Ladyship take her medicine.

23:53.320 --> 23:54.600
I dare not go against his order.

24:01.240 --> 24:02.640
Here, My Lady.

24:11.400 --> 24:13.400
My Lady, have a candied fruit.

24:23.640 --> 24:25.280
My Lady, your stomach is in pain.

24:25.360 --> 24:27.320
Why did you go through with the Nuo dance?

24:28.160 --> 24:31.120
You were the victor
and received all the praise.

24:31.720 --> 24:33.920
Why are you still upset?

24:35.600 --> 24:36.600
It's too quiet.

24:39.400 --> 24:40.400
I'm afraid.

24:41.200 --> 24:42.440
What are you afraid of?

24:43.080 --> 24:45.080
The calm before the storm.

24:53.400 --> 24:54.240
Bitao.

24:54.960 --> 24:56.840
There's something on my mind.

24:57.440 --> 25:00.560
If you can't decide what to do, what then?

25:01.520 --> 25:03.600
My Lady, what about tossing bamboo tokens?

25:08.800 --> 25:12.360
If they land on different sides,
what you want can be done.

25:12.440 --> 25:15.280
If both land on the dark side,
it's forbidden by Heaven.

25:15.360 --> 25:18.000
If both land on the bright side,
you have to do it again.

25:18.080 --> 25:19.960
What do you want to ask, My Lady?

25:21.240 --> 25:24.840
Lord Lu is arrogant and suspicious.

25:25.360 --> 25:27.080
He kept testing me. A real handful.

25:32.240 --> 25:34.320
The capital is full of nobles.

25:35.160 --> 25:37.320
He is not the only one I can rely on.

25:38.880 --> 25:40.520
I want to ask Heaven.

25:42.560 --> 25:44.600
Is it possible to rely on someone else?

25:52.960 --> 25:54.880
My Lady, they both land on the dark side.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.040
Heaven says it's not viable.

25:56.120 --> 25:57.720
It's impossible.

26:00.520 --> 26:02.360
Heaven says no.

26:04.520 --> 26:05.960
But I say otherwise.

26:18.480 --> 26:19.720
Be careful.

26:19.800 --> 26:20.960
-Here. I will take it.
-Okay.

26:21.560 --> 26:22.680
Be careful.

26:22.760 --> 26:23.680
What's going on?

26:23.760 --> 26:25.320
Who told you to move all of these?

26:25.920 --> 26:28.400
Put them back. Put all of them back.

26:31.280 --> 26:33.440
My Lord. Old Madam says

26:33.520 --> 26:36.000
a newly married couple
cannot live separately for too long.

26:36.600 --> 26:39.720
If people start talking,
it'll also be a disgrace for Her Ladyship.

26:39.800 --> 26:43.000
Old Madam asks you
to move back to the inner quarters.

26:44.280 --> 26:45.640
That won't do.

26:45.720 --> 26:47.200
Lord Lu isn't fully recovered yet.

26:47.960 --> 26:51.120
The physician ordered him to
abstain from carnal pleasures strictly.

26:51.880 --> 26:53.400
My Lord, am I right?

26:55.720 --> 26:57.080
I understand.

26:57.160 --> 26:59.400
You hear that? Pack up everything.

26:59.480 --> 27:00.880
Be careful.

27:00.960 --> 27:04.200
Don't be clumsy and
damage His Lordship's military scrolls.

27:04.280 --> 27:05.440
‎Got it.

27:32.440 --> 27:34.160
I didn't mean to doubt you.

27:37.280 --> 27:39.000
I heard reports from the servants

27:39.520 --> 27:43.120
that you tossed the Han family's gift
for some unknown reason.

27:43.760 --> 27:45.360
Also the secret meeting with your cousin.

27:46.360 --> 27:47.920
I was worried that
other people might find out

27:48.440 --> 27:50.040
and gossip about it.

27:50.560 --> 27:51.680
It would make you upset.

27:54.080 --> 27:55.640
I didn't mean to test you,

27:58.040 --> 27:59.560
much less hurt you.

28:17.880 --> 28:20.840
If you don't like it,
I won't question any further.

28:21.440 --> 28:23.160
However, the time limit
of one or two years,

28:24.000 --> 28:25.680
don't bring it up so casually anymore.

28:25.760 --> 28:29.800
If my grandmother finds out,
it is bound to cause a huge uproar.

28:30.840 --> 28:32.680
Grandmother had someone
move my belongings here.

28:33.280 --> 28:34.440
I'll ask them

28:34.520 --> 28:36.360
to move all my stuff to the adjacent room.

28:37.160 --> 28:38.280
I'll be staying over there.

28:46.600 --> 28:47.440
Wei Rao?

28:55.560 --> 28:56.800
Servants!

28:58.280 --> 29:00.760
My Lord, General Qi
is here to pay a sick visit.

29:00.840 --> 29:02.680
Her Ladyship is greeting him
at Jiangyun Hall now.

29:03.680 --> 29:05.360
JIANGYUN HALL

29:05.440 --> 29:08.080
The Zhongwan pressure point

29:08.600 --> 29:10.280
is located in the upper abdomen,
roughly one,

29:10.360 --> 29:13.080
two, three, four inches above.

29:13.160 --> 29:16.120
I understand now
after your demonstration, General Qi.

29:34.160 --> 29:35.640
What's going on in here?

29:35.720 --> 29:36.680
It's all smoky and stifling.

29:37.560 --> 29:40.080
Anyone who didn't know
would think there's a fire in here.

29:41.880 --> 29:43.320
Lady Wei Rao has a stomach problem

29:43.400 --> 29:45.120
must be a weak constitution,

29:45.200 --> 29:46.160
made worse by the cold.

29:46.840 --> 29:49.040
I'm teaching Bitao to use
a moxibustion stick to treat the Zhongwan,

29:49.120 --> 29:50.520
Liangmen, and Zusanli points.

29:50.600 --> 29:52.440
She only needs
the treatment every other day.

29:52.960 --> 29:54.040
It'll be beneficial for her.

29:55.120 --> 29:57.920
You even know her maid's name?

30:00.200 --> 30:01.600
I've known you for so many years,

30:02.560 --> 30:04.520
but I didn't know you knew moxibustion.

30:04.600 --> 30:06.280
Little food and medicine
back at the frontier.

30:06.360 --> 30:07.400
What we lacked most were physicians.

30:08.080 --> 30:10.920
I've treated wounds
for you and the soldiers.

30:11.440 --> 30:13.240
This is nothing much for me.

30:15.160 --> 30:16.960
From your mistress's complexion,

30:17.040 --> 30:18.920
too much cold, raw food.
Her qi is insufficient.

30:19.000 --> 30:20.480
She should cut down on noodles.

30:20.560 --> 30:21.800
It's bad for digestion.

30:22.560 --> 30:25.040
If she can't have rice on its own,
you can steam it with sweet dates.

30:25.920 --> 30:27.120
I understand.

30:28.360 --> 30:31.680
You haven't told me where the Liangmen
and Zusanli points are located.

30:32.480 --> 30:34.080
Why did you stop?

30:35.680 --> 30:36.560
Also on the upper abdomen.

30:38.480 --> 30:40.600
Look. This is the Liangmen pressure point.

30:44.720 --> 30:45.920
This is the Zusanli point.

30:51.360 --> 30:52.560
My Lord, what do you want?

30:55.080 --> 30:56.240
This is a small room.

30:56.320 --> 30:58.560
What if you're choked
by the moxibustion smoke?

31:11.440 --> 31:12.280
All of you, leave.

31:18.960 --> 31:20.960
What? Did you two argue?

31:21.600 --> 31:24.000
General Qi, you are close to Lord Lu.

31:24.080 --> 31:25.520
Tell me.

31:26.160 --> 31:31.480
Why would a husband
refuse to open up to his wife?

31:32.000 --> 31:35.600
No matter how hard I beg,
he will not communicate with me.

31:36.200 --> 31:38.960
And why would he
sleep in a different room and ignore me?

31:39.560 --> 31:41.760
When I accidentally touch his hand,

31:41.840 --> 31:43.200
he will be enraged

31:43.720 --> 31:46.200
as if I'm infected with the plague
and will transmit it to him.

31:47.320 --> 31:49.680
You are the one who knows him best.

31:49.760 --> 31:51.240
Please enlighten me.

31:51.840 --> 31:56.400
Am I so hideous and vulgar
that I'm not worth a glance?

31:57.000 --> 31:59.040
Naturally, you're… very pretty.

32:00.760 --> 32:03.640
However, Lu Zhuo
is someone who doesn't show his feelings.

32:05.200 --> 32:06.200
Don't take it to heart.

32:07.800 --> 32:11.840
Perhaps he hates me
and dislikes everything about me.

32:13.120 --> 32:15.000
It's all the fault
of useless generals like you.

32:16.000 --> 32:17.840
I really hate that war.

32:17.920 --> 32:21.000
It ties up two people who hate each other.

32:22.040 --> 32:24.240
My life has been ruined.

32:39.440 --> 32:40.680
I don't know how to comfort you.

32:41.360 --> 32:42.880
Whatever I say will be wrong now.

32:44.120 --> 32:45.000
Please accept my apology.

32:54.600 --> 32:56.160
Who needs your apology?

32:56.840 --> 32:59.520
Is it also your fault that he hates me?

33:00.840 --> 33:02.680
In the future,
if you are upset with anything,

33:02.760 --> 33:03.680
just tell me.

33:04.320 --> 33:07.160
If I can be of your service,
I will never refuse.

33:07.240 --> 33:09.960
GALAXY OF VERSES

33:10.040 --> 33:11.520
It's my own misfortune.

33:12.320 --> 33:13.880
Who are you to me?

33:13.960 --> 33:15.800
I dare not ask you to serve me.

33:17.080 --> 33:19.800
Leave. Never return again.

33:20.320 --> 33:21.800
I also get angry when I see you.

33:24.720 --> 33:26.160
Lady Wei Rao, take care.

33:32.120 --> 33:33.120
Why didn't you address me
as sister-in-law?

33:36.680 --> 33:37.960
How rude.

34:21.000 --> 34:23.719
Eating rice with soup
is bad for your illness.

34:24.320 --> 34:25.679
Old habits die hard.

34:33.600 --> 34:36.280
Don't you have anything to say to me?

34:36.880 --> 34:38.520
No chatting while dining.

34:39.280 --> 34:41.120
I'm not trying to control your behavior,

34:41.639 --> 34:43.280
but Qi Zhongkai is an outsider.

34:43.360 --> 34:44.920
I've taken a fancy to your good friend.

34:46.280 --> 34:47.120
What did you say?

34:50.719 --> 34:54.600
I'm telling you that I fancy Qi Zhongkai.

34:57.960 --> 34:59.200
A married woman

34:59.280 --> 35:01.440
saying something like that
before her husband.

35:01.520 --> 35:02.800
How dare you?

35:03.400 --> 35:04.800
Why not?

35:04.880 --> 35:06.160
I'm rather ignorant.

35:06.760 --> 35:07.600
I knew that your mother was in a rush

35:07.680 --> 35:09.280
to marry someone else
after your father passed away,

35:09.800 --> 35:11.320
but I didn't expect you to outdo her.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.560
You've been married for a mere two months,

35:13.640 --> 35:15.000
and you already
set your eye on another man.

35:15.080 --> 35:17.000
Your husband is still alive!

35:17.080 --> 35:17.920
You…

35:22.040 --> 35:23.440
Shameless!

35:24.240 --> 35:26.920
I only married into the Lu family
for the auspicious match.

35:28.120 --> 35:29.960
Your cousin came to fetch the bride.

35:30.040 --> 35:31.200
I went through the ritual with a rooster.

35:32.080 --> 35:34.680
Later, you even refused
to take me as your wife.

35:34.760 --> 35:37.440
I've never worshipped
at your ancestral hall.

35:37.960 --> 35:39.040
The ritual hasn't been completed.

35:39.760 --> 35:41.480
I'm not considered
a bride of the Lu family.

35:42.240 --> 35:45.120
What binds us is just a decree
from the Empress Dowager.

35:46.240 --> 35:48.040
Yet imperial decree
is inferior to human hearts.

35:48.640 --> 35:50.560
Marriage is determined by fate,

35:50.640 --> 35:51.600
never meant to be forced.

35:52.200 --> 35:55.640
After all, one year will go by
in the blink of an eye.

35:56.520 --> 35:57.880
I must make plans for myself after all.

36:06.360 --> 36:09.280
Then, what do you plan to do?

36:13.760 --> 36:15.040
I heard

36:15.800 --> 36:17.160
you've fancied someone else for a while.

36:17.760 --> 36:19.840
Xie Hualou is indeed pretty and talented.

36:20.360 --> 36:23.960
Now, I'm willing to be the matchmaker
and plan for both of you.

36:24.640 --> 36:27.840
In the future,
when both of you marry each other,

36:28.520 --> 36:31.640
let's call it making up for my mistakes.

36:32.720 --> 36:33.560
So?

36:37.920 --> 36:40.360
The Xie family has been
grand tutors for two dynasties.

36:40.440 --> 36:42.800
They would never allow their granddaughter
to be someone's second wife.

36:42.880 --> 36:43.960
This isn't easy.

36:44.040 --> 36:45.640
Without my help,

36:45.720 --> 36:47.960
you will never be with her.

36:48.040 --> 36:49.040
So,

36:50.480 --> 36:52.120
I won't do this
without getting something in return.

36:53.320 --> 36:56.280
You want me to matchmake you two
as a middleman?

36:56.880 --> 36:57.840
Not at all.

36:58.840 --> 37:01.040
I just need you to be tolerant

37:02.080 --> 37:03.080
and generous.

37:04.160 --> 37:05.320
If you don't interfere,

37:06.520 --> 37:08.720
I have my own way of making this happen.

37:10.560 --> 37:11.400
I understand.

37:16.200 --> 37:17.760
Lord Lu, you don't look too well.

37:19.680 --> 37:20.560
What's wrong?

37:22.560 --> 37:23.880
Everything you said is reasonable.

37:23.960 --> 37:26.680
Since we are not a real couple,
I can't tell you what to do.

37:27.280 --> 37:30.280
Your plan is perfect,
but extremely difficult to execute.

37:31.240 --> 37:32.160
After all,

37:32.680 --> 37:34.480
the tongue is as sharp as a sword.

37:34.560 --> 37:35.640
It kills without spilling blood.

37:36.600 --> 37:38.560
All three families are nobles.

37:39.880 --> 37:41.640
Fooling around with marriage
is ridiculous.

37:50.840 --> 37:53.880
Even if you have a plan,
you need to carry it out slowly.

37:55.040 --> 37:57.960
Don't draw attention and act so openly.

37:58.040 --> 38:01.680
I will be cautious
and not make myself a laughingstock.

38:08.320 --> 38:10.760
Thank you, my Lord,
for your gracious favor.

38:18.080 --> 38:22.760
HERITAGE PRESERVED, GOODNESS PROCLAIMED

38:27.920 --> 38:29.160
My Lady, don't stay out.

38:29.240 --> 38:30.880
You might fall ill again at night.

38:34.560 --> 38:35.600
Why are you laughing, My Lady?

38:36.760 --> 38:40.320
I'm laughing because someone might
get too angry to sleep tonight.

38:42.280 --> 38:44.800
My Lady, do you mean…

38:44.880 --> 38:46.720
Madam Liu used to tell me

38:47.520 --> 38:49.240
that that's all there is to humanity.

38:50.240 --> 38:52.280
People don't cherish what they get easily.

38:52.920 --> 38:56.680
When there's competition,
even slop tastes better.

38:59.360 --> 39:00.320
Go to sleep.

39:09.040 --> 39:11.520
SONGYUE HALL

39:15.680 --> 39:17.120
SHIZHAI

39:18.600 --> 39:20.200
The wounds haven't completely healed yet.

39:20.280 --> 39:22.800
Yet practicing swordsmanship
since midnight.

39:23.320 --> 39:25.280
Where's all this energy coming from?

39:33.560 --> 39:34.760
Zhuo.

39:37.000 --> 39:37.840
It's me.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.080
It's you?

39:44.000 --> 39:47.520
My eyes are blurred,
and I couldn't recognize you.

39:50.080 --> 39:52.920
Old Madam threatened
to confine you here with her life.

39:53.000 --> 39:55.040
I am kind enough
to bring you news from court.

39:55.760 --> 39:57.440
Is this how you repay me?

39:58.480 --> 40:00.000
I've taken a fancy to your good friend.

40:03.600 --> 40:04.640
Zhao Song.

40:07.360 --> 40:09.280
Lying around all day,
everything feels weak.

40:10.520 --> 40:11.360
Just got the itch, that's all.

40:12.040 --> 40:13.480
When you are fully recovered,

40:14.080 --> 40:15.320
I'll practice with you.

40:15.400 --> 40:16.480
Are the Hans attempting something again?

40:17.480 --> 40:18.720
You are right.

40:19.360 --> 40:21.360
The Hans have offered
many treasures to the palace.

40:21.880 --> 40:23.000
They have been recorded here.

40:23.080 --> 40:24.600
Han Liao might be
the Empress Dowager's family,

40:24.680 --> 40:26.160
but he's a distant relative.

40:26.760 --> 40:28.760
Without the Marquis of Xiting
and his son's help,

40:29.840 --> 40:30.960
he wouldn't have climbed
up the ranks so quickly.

40:35.680 --> 40:36.720
Jiede,

40:37.600 --> 40:39.480
I asked you to buy the Pig Skin Pancake.

40:40.040 --> 40:41.280
Did you get them?

40:46.760 --> 40:47.720
I sent someone to get them yesterday.

40:48.320 --> 40:49.480
Please give me one more day.

40:49.560 --> 40:50.520
I'll surely get it tomorrow.

40:51.520 --> 40:52.360
Pig Skin Pancake?

40:54.880 --> 40:57.800
The pastry Wei Rao saw at the Western
Market on the night of Qixi.

40:58.440 --> 41:00.960
She said it was a pancake
made from rice slurry.

41:01.040 --> 41:03.200
After drizzling hemp milk on it,
its skin is as smooth as a pig's skin.

41:03.280 --> 41:05.880
Unfortunately,
we left in a hurry and didn't buy it.

41:06.400 --> 41:08.640
When we came back,
it was always on her mind.

41:11.240 --> 41:12.080
Keep searching.

41:12.880 --> 41:13.720
Yes.

41:16.720 --> 41:18.800
Pig Skin Pancake?

41:18.880 --> 41:22.000
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

41:33.360 --> 41:36.560
My Lord, General Qi left his residence
and headed east.

41:38.600 --> 41:40.840
-East?
-Yes. The people tailing him said

41:40.920 --> 41:42.480
he first went to the Western Market,

41:42.560 --> 41:43.600
before going to Liu Market.

41:44.200 --> 41:45.400
He seemed to be looking for something.

41:49.320 --> 41:51.200
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

41:54.680 --> 41:56.320
Both of them have feelings for each other.

41:57.760 --> 41:59.040
I, the husband,

42:00.120 --> 42:02.000
have become irrelevant.

42:02.720 --> 42:04.120
I'm merely an eyesore here.

42:04.840 --> 42:07.160
MANIFEST AND MAKE YOUR VIRTUE SHINE

42:09.160 --> 42:10.640
It is said that
the great affairs of a state

42:10.720 --> 42:11.640
are sacrifice and war.

42:11.720 --> 42:13.520
What holds true for a state
holds true for a family as well.

42:13.600 --> 42:16.400
In the past, you were the one organizing
the Mengqiu Family Mourning Ritual.

42:17.280 --> 42:18.200
Yesterday, Mother told me

42:18.880 --> 42:20.680
that hosting the ritual
was the principal wife's duty.

42:21.360 --> 42:23.320
Mother is weak and can't handle the task.

42:23.920 --> 42:25.760
That's why you have had to carry
the burden at such an old age.

42:26.360 --> 42:27.760
With a bride this year,

42:29.680 --> 42:30.600
Mother will have another helper.

42:31.200 --> 42:32.920
It is only natural
for her to manage the ritual.

42:35.800 --> 42:37.480
Young Master, you are still young.

42:37.560 --> 42:38.600
You don't know what's important.

42:39.280 --> 42:42.360
The ritual is different from organizing
Mother's birthday banquet.

42:42.440 --> 42:44.480
The birthday banquet
is a celebratory event.

42:44.560 --> 42:46.760
It's fine as long as
there aren't any major mistakes.

42:46.840 --> 42:49.160
The mourning ritual
is a huge thing for the clan.

42:50.000 --> 42:51.680
Not only are the rules complicated,

42:51.760 --> 42:55.760
but hundreds of people from the clan
will be watching and looking for faults.

42:56.360 --> 42:58.640
You better not cause trouble
for your wife.

42:59.240 --> 43:00.440
Right.

43:00.960 --> 43:04.120
Wanniang. You have always
been calm and unassuming.

43:04.200 --> 43:06.080
You don't like meddling
in the clan's business.

43:06.160 --> 43:07.760
The children are eager for quick success.

43:07.840 --> 43:09.080
Can't you talk to them?

43:09.800 --> 43:10.640
Exactly.

43:13.040 --> 43:14.800
Both of you are right.

43:15.400 --> 43:17.640
The Mengqiu Family Mourning Ritual
is a big deal.

43:18.240 --> 43:20.040
I dare not host it no matter what.

43:21.640 --> 43:22.640
Don't joke around, My Lord.

43:23.600 --> 43:26.760
I'm proposing this
because of another reason.

43:28.600 --> 43:31.320
A marriage ties two families together.

43:31.400 --> 43:33.560
They are to honor the ancestors
and carry on the family lineage.

43:34.240 --> 43:35.480
When a woman marries into the family,

43:35.560 --> 43:37.000
she must first go through the ceremony

43:37.080 --> 43:40.360
to get the ancestors' blessing before
she can become a part of the Lu family.

43:41.960 --> 43:44.160
During the wedding, I was sick

43:44.760 --> 43:46.560
and failed to present my wife
to the ancestors.

43:47.080 --> 43:48.240
At the time of Mengqiu Family Ritual,

43:49.040 --> 43:50.080
we can make up for the ancestral ceremony.

43:56.080 --> 43:59.960
Grandmother, Wei Rao's marriage blessed me
and saved my life.

44:00.040 --> 44:02.080
If I made her a subject of gossip
due to incomplete rites,

44:03.000 --> 44:04.840
the Heaven will punish me.

44:04.920 --> 44:08.400
Old Madam, there's no need for this.

44:08.920 --> 44:11.640
I dare not manage the family ritual.

44:12.240 --> 44:14.520
You young ones know nothing.

44:14.600 --> 44:17.560
A bride going through
the ancestral temple ceremony

44:17.640 --> 44:19.600
is more important
than greeting the aunts and uncles.

44:19.680 --> 44:24.400
Once a bride bows to the ancestors,
it's set in stone.

44:25.080 --> 44:28.920
You will be the Lu family's
principal wife,

44:29.000 --> 44:32.280
the Duke's Residence's
future lady of the house.

44:33.800 --> 44:36.000
Rao, you hear that?

44:36.080 --> 44:39.840
Lu Zhuo is the eldest son,
the pillar of the family.

44:39.920 --> 44:42.080
He will inherit
the duke's title in the future.

44:42.160 --> 44:44.200
You've got a heavy load
on your shoulders too.

44:44.280 --> 44:47.000
Forget the distant ones,
consider these two aunts before you.

44:47.880 --> 44:48.960
They might be your elders,

44:49.040 --> 44:51.040
But for big clan affairs

44:51.120 --> 44:53.360
they have to take orders
from the clan matriarch.

44:53.440 --> 44:54.480
Right?

44:58.800 --> 44:59.720
Rao,

45:01.920 --> 45:03.120
I'll leave everything to you.

45:12.240 --> 45:14.320
LU'S ANCESTRAL TEMPLE

45:33.840 --> 45:35.400
We decided to be a fake couple.

45:36.160 --> 45:37.920
Why must you go through
with the temple ceremony?

45:38.520 --> 45:39.760
So much trouble, for nothing

45:39.840 --> 45:41.200
It will not end well in future.

45:45.840 --> 45:49.120
An old saying goes, "if the title isn't
right, nothing you say carries weight."

45:50.200 --> 45:53.520
Even if you're the principal wife
for just a month and not a year,

45:53.600 --> 45:54.640
managing the household,

45:54.720 --> 45:56.280
attending to guests
and keeping servants in check

45:56.360 --> 45:57.640
are no easy tasks.

45:57.720 --> 45:58.600
A LOYAL HEART SHINES BRIGHT

45:58.680 --> 46:01.240
Wei Rao. My mother is gentle and meek,

46:01.320 --> 46:02.640
but not good at managing people

46:02.720 --> 46:04.840
I hope you can be
a capable wife by my side

46:04.920 --> 46:06.600
to keep my aunts in check.

46:07.640 --> 46:08.920
How can you do that
without a proper title?

46:09.680 --> 46:10.720
That's all?

46:14.040 --> 46:15.560
What else can it be?

46:17.240 --> 46:18.320
No need to be so distrustful.

46:18.920 --> 46:20.520
When it's time to part ways, we do it.

46:21.040 --> 46:22.240
I, Lu Zhuo, am a man of my word.

46:23.240 --> 46:24.760
I won't force you to stay for any longer.

46:27.560 --> 46:29.120
Don't worry.

46:29.200 --> 46:30.080
Your work won't be for nothing.

46:30.680 --> 46:32.600
Grandmother promised you
ten thousand taels of dowry.

46:32.680 --> 46:35.480
A year later, I'll carry out her promise.

46:36.360 --> 46:37.760
I don't want your jewelry.

46:42.080 --> 46:44.840
Do you want people to laugh and say

46:45.440 --> 46:48.640
the Lu family's bride
cannot even be allowed

46:49.840 --> 46:50.880
to pray at the ancestral temple?

46:50.960 --> 46:52.000
You…

46:57.320 --> 46:58.400
Fine, go ahead.

47:04.560 --> 47:06.080
A gentleman's promise must be kept.

47:06.160 --> 47:07.640
You must keep your word.

47:08.800 --> 47:09.720
Don't worry.

47:12.560 --> 47:14.000
Everyone, be careful.

47:46.560 --> 47:48.760
What? She's not in again?

47:48.840 --> 47:50.560
General, she's really not in.

47:51.160 --> 47:53.080
Lady Wei Rao
wants to eat Pig Skin Pancake.

47:53.160 --> 47:54.840
I searched every market to find it

47:54.920 --> 47:56.240
and so it wouldn't go cold,

47:56.320 --> 47:57.800
I brought someone here to make it.

47:58.320 --> 48:00.000
Three days in a row, not a sign of her.

48:01.000 --> 48:02.080
Tell me honestly.

48:02.640 --> 48:03.960
Did you send my message

48:04.640 --> 48:07.160
or did Lu Zhuo purposely prevent us
from meeting each other?

48:09.600 --> 48:11.880
-Ridiculous.
-That's not it.

48:11.960 --> 48:13.200
The Hungry Ghost Festival is near,

48:13.280 --> 48:15.000
Lady Lu is busy preparing for the ritual.

48:15.080 --> 48:17.960
She goes out at sunrise
and only returns at sunset.

48:18.560 --> 48:20.040
She even has to do her hair and makeup
in the horse carriage.

48:20.120 --> 48:21.200
She is too busy to meet guests.

48:21.280 --> 48:23.960
Please forgive her for not meeting you.

48:26.920 --> 48:29.160
Fine. I'll return another day.

48:30.000 --> 48:31.880
Farewell, General. Take care.

48:31.960 --> 48:33.400
LU'S ANCESTRAL TEMPLE

48:33.480 --> 48:36.720
-She's out!
-The bride who blessed the heir is out!

48:36.800 --> 48:39.840
Someone who was almost dead recovered
thanks to her blessing.

48:39.920 --> 48:41.840
She is truly blessed.

48:41.920 --> 48:43.000
What are we still waiting for?

48:43.080 --> 48:45.440
Let's go closer
to get some of her blessing.

48:45.520 --> 48:46.680
Let us get some of your blessing!

48:46.760 --> 48:47.880
Let us get some of your blessing!

48:47.960 --> 48:49.720
A-Chou, I'm here!

48:49.800 --> 48:51.360
-Let us get some!
-It's me!

48:51.440 --> 48:52.760
It's me, A-Chou!

48:54.200 --> 48:55.240
A-Chou!

48:55.760 --> 48:58.120
A-Chou! Over here, A-Chou!

48:58.200 --> 48:59.720
It's me, A-Chou!

49:00.320 --> 49:01.800
I'm here!

49:01.880 --> 49:03.400
-It's me!
-Madam!

49:04.120 --> 49:05.800
-A-Chou!
-Wei Rao.

49:07.560 --> 49:08.920
It's me, A-Chou!

49:09.520 --> 49:11.360
-A-Chou!
-Madam!

49:11.440 --> 49:12.640
A-Chou!

49:13.160 --> 49:14.640
It's me, A-Chou!

49:15.160 --> 49:16.720
A-Chou!

49:16.800 --> 49:17.920
Let us have some blessings!

49:18.000 --> 49:19.160
-A-Chou!
-Let us have some!

49:19.240 --> 49:20.080
A-Chou!

49:21.240 --> 49:22.080
It's me!

49:22.160 --> 49:23.520
A-Chou!

49:23.600 --> 49:24.560
I'm here!

49:25.400 --> 49:26.920
-It's me, A-Chou!
-Don't worry, My Lady.

49:27.000 --> 49:28.840
-Madam!
-A-Chou!

49:29.720 --> 49:31.040
A-Chou!

49:31.120 --> 49:31.960
Get lost!

49:38.520 --> 49:40.320
Come take a look inside.

49:40.400 --> 49:41.360
-Hold it.
-Come inside.

49:44.280 --> 49:45.440
Her Ladyship has ordered

49:45.520 --> 49:48.800
to find the beggar from just now
without causing a scene.

49:51.640 --> 49:52.640
I don't know.

49:52.720 --> 49:53.680
I haven't seen him.

49:53.760 --> 49:55.880
‎-Come and have a look.
‎-These are quite fresh.

49:55.960 --> 49:57.440
‎Good.

50:08.520 --> 50:10.040
A-Chou's really made it.

50:11.480 --> 50:14.360
She lives a better life than the deities!

50:17.640 --> 50:20.920
Tell me. Why didn't she share
all this fortune with us?

50:21.520 --> 50:22.840
Don't speak nonsense.

50:23.360 --> 50:25.800
Ma is very ill,
and we've spent all our money.

50:25.880 --> 50:27.400
That is why we took the risk
to return and find A-Chou.

50:28.000 --> 50:29.280
Did she say when we can meet her?

50:29.360 --> 50:30.800
Mother's illness cannot wait.

50:32.360 --> 50:34.920
I'm late. Sorry for making you wait.

50:36.800 --> 50:37.640
Forgive me.

50:46.200 --> 50:47.280
Where is my sister?

50:47.360 --> 50:48.880
Why isn't she coming to meet us?

50:49.440 --> 50:51.560
Your sister is now the wife of the heir.

50:51.640 --> 50:52.920
She is busy because of her duties.

50:53.640 --> 50:57.760
However, she still cares for you
and told me to take care of you.

50:59.120 --> 51:00.120
Someone.

51:12.360 --> 51:13.400
Quick.

51:16.200 --> 51:18.080
I'm very close to your sister.

51:18.600 --> 51:20.920
I'll treat her mother like my own,

51:21.800 --> 51:25.160
and her siblings like my own.

51:25.240 --> 51:26.840
I've called a famous physician
for you, Madam.

51:26.920 --> 51:28.200
He will be here after the meal.

51:28.280 --> 51:30.840
All of you just need to live here
with peace of mind.

51:30.920 --> 51:33.360
If you need anything, just let me know.

51:33.960 --> 51:34.800
Please.

51:38.120 --> 51:40.360
Since you are A-Chou's friend,
we are a family.

51:40.440 --> 51:42.480
Come. Sit down. Let's eat.

51:54.360 --> 51:55.360
Wei Rao.

51:55.880 --> 51:58.480
I will treat them well for you.

51:59.520 --> 52:01.920
The person
I saw outside the temple that day.

52:02.000 --> 52:04.200
Ask Liangcai to keep an eye in the city.

52:04.280 --> 52:05.760
Report to me if he finds anything.

52:05.840 --> 52:06.840
I understand.

52:08.600 --> 52:09.560
Foolish!

52:11.280 --> 52:12.600
My Lady, you are too kind.

52:12.680 --> 52:14.320
How can you not punish such clumsiness?

52:14.400 --> 52:16.280
It's improper if others see this.

52:21.200 --> 52:22.320
A-Chou, is this nice?

52:26.960 --> 52:29.160
My Lady, to know more about
the red string's owner,

52:29.760 --> 52:32.360
come to Triumph Tavern
at three-quarters past the hour of Wei.

52:32.440 --> 52:34.720
Arrive late, and we won't be waiting.

54:56.200 --> 54:58.520
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
